# Credential notes (R0.3). These are local-only working files. Real values
# belong in Cloudflare Pages / Railway / Supabase secret storage, never here.
# Narrow on purpose: this blocks the known credential-note filenames, it is not
# a blanket rule that would hide an unrelated leak from review.
test_credentials.md
**/test_credentials.md
credentials.md
**/credentials.md
*.credentials.md

